<title>USA: Hancock completes Bank of Commerce merger.</title>
<headline>Hancock completes Bank of Commerce merger.</headline>
<dateline>GULFPORT, Miss. 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hancock Holding Co said Wednesday it had completed the merger, announced in February, with Bank of Commerce &amp; Trust Co.</p>
<p>Under the merger, approved at a special meeting of Commerce Corp shareholders on June 18, Bank of Commerce &amp; Trust Co was merged into Hancock Bank of Louisiana, and its holding company, Commerce Corp, was merged into Hancock Holding, the company said.</p>
</text>
